sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Front-end User
    participant Frontend
    actor Client
    participant SocketServer as Socket.IO Server
    participant Auth as Auth

    User->>Frontend: opens application
    Frontend->>Client: Connect with ?token=... (namespace /)
    Client->>SocketServer: Connect with ?token=... (namespace /)
    SocketServer->>Auth: AuthenticateFromHeader(Bearer token)
    alt invalid or missing token
        Auth-->>SocketServer: error
        SocketServer-->>Client: connection error
        Client->>Frontend: connection error
        Frontend->>User: displays connection error
    else valid token
        Auth-->>SocketServer: claims
        SocketServer->>SocketServer: set SocketContext(member_id)
        SocketServer-->>Client: connection ok
        Client->>Frontend: connection ok
        Frontend->>User: displays connected
    end
